{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0264_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7cee22b220804170116ac46ed97f00860aa793fc78ef4eaadec7efdf114fc540", "ja": "(朋花と、ファッション誌の撮影に来た。景観が自慢の\n庭園らしいから、休憩中に少し回ってみるか……）", "zh": "（和朋花一起来到了时尚杂志的拍摄现场。听说这里的庭园\n以景观出名，趁着休息时间去逛一逛吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0264_1001_031tom", "source_sha256": "ca65e4b0eb45096ef95f588d562027a23e436512be7cec311a8a1e02523ca77e", "ja": "{$P$}さん、見てください～。\nほら、とても綺麗ですよ～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，快看呀～。\n您瞧，非常漂亮呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0264_1002_031tom", "source_sha256": "46006a41d197e15343b92e172dedc73dab04a0e48512fff3a75baa1cb9eaa00c", "ja": "丁寧にお手入れされていますね～。\nお花たちの喜びの声が、聞こえてくるようです～。", "zh": "打理得真仔细呢～  \n仿佛都能听到花儿们喜悦的声音了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0264_1003_p", "source_sha256": "bc68811790893fe28e39bbe9ccea5f3aad001f785d75a8fdaec0d4786cbf5c7d", "ja": "本当に立派な庭園だよな。\nまだ時間はあるし、もうちょっと歩こうか？", "zh": "真是座气派的庭园啊。\n时间还早，再走一会儿吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0264_1004_031tom", "source_sha256": "5cd70d28db9153d419e0247995c2ba4a431554594e8161fca50a98586b2e2c36", "ja": "はい～……うふふ。\nしっかりとエスコート、お願いしますね～。うふふ。", "zh": "好的～……呵呵。\n要好好地护送我哦～呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0264_1005_null", "source_sha256": "dc5f1bf6bc53203f9d51a9dd9dd69f9dec0997508f8829b0dbe204d424b86047", "ja": "ポツリ……", "zh": "喃喃自语……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0264_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "3e113b010f5e9a8c6d673f1b0736407b199946acdb7d5fb891fe4bc0a0b6f5df", "ja": "……あら？", "zh": "……哎呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0264_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c789d4ed6c796dbb36e1b30a3ed5bf7e4440e8ea461e559b59143d197b72f183", "ja": "っと……雨か。撮影もあるし、濡れたらまずいな……。\n確か敷地内にカフェがあったはずだから、行こう！", "zh": "呃……下雨了吗。还有拍摄工作，要是淋湿了可不好办……。\n我记得园区里好像有家咖啡厅，去那里吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0264_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "b51c6b4796a8fe45d4fca4a06f1d47a0c420c4833d5a04dd1c08180b9e46bd25", "ja": "わかりました～。\n衣装のままですが……緊急事態ですからね～。", "zh": "好的～。\n虽然还穿着演出服……不过毕竟是紧急情况呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0264_1009_se", "source_sha256": "c2bda998f3305a68db995e7d14bc0e34b321ddb5d7b2d98f0fde69bbd1128866", "ja": "ザーッ！", "zh": "哗——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0264_1010_031tom", "source_sha256": "52bd708c32672fe86cf6937884bbd0aacada974273852b737e51d6b91f490afe", "ja": "……。\n雨、なかなか止みませんね～。", "zh": "……\n雨一时半会儿还停不了呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0264_1011_p", "source_sha256": "65afc96511621a5b804883277c71c48b390a8f8850bda186b22164b83482db06", "ja": "本降りになってきちゃったな。この後の撮影について、\nスタッフさん達と話をしないと……。", "zh": "下起大雨来了。关于接下来的拍摄，得和工作人员们商量一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0264_1012_031tom", "source_sha256": "ae93e49ff00c05406f86465fcff4b85c2c33b1d797fb0064c61ce53070abf702", "ja": "でも、{$P$}さんのおかげで、\n濡れずに済みました～。良い働きでしたね～。", "zh": "不过，多亏了{$P$}先生，总算没淋湿呢～。真是派上了用场呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0264_1013_031tom", "source_sha256": "00564dcae414f12d2920f2beb0105f9ee79e9caf2b9fe48c13c515d03611eb85", "ja": "ただ……少しだけ残念です～。\n私としては、もう少し散歩したかったのですが～……。", "zh": "不过……还是稍微有点遗憾呢～\n对我来说，本来还想再散一会儿步的～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0264_1014_p", "source_sha256": "be371818f5a642217ea7d06324962ee0893cf8606de9efafe17dd879ca0f9202", "ja": "そうだな、全然見られなかったし……。\nなんなら撮影の後に、もう一度歩くか？", "zh": "是啊，完全没怎么逛到……  \n要不拍摄结束后，再走一遍？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0264_1015_031tom", "source_sha256": "fef23b5baa3111f8324d8c7c904beb98aa3ab62b63e4e439f3ee73db7910e3c3", "ja": "あら～？　うふふ……。\nそんな事を言ってしまって、いいんですか～？", "zh": "哎呀～？呵呵呵……  \n说出这种话，真的没关系吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0264_1016_031tom", "source_sha256": "7b0b2fc687cd1581e9b2adb9c8c1de79332a0e308333cab9888bf4eed5f6a566", "ja": "雨が止むかも、わからないのに……。\nできないかもしれない約束は、してはいけませんよ～。", "zh": "明明还不知道雨会不会停……可能无法实现的约定，是不能做的哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0264_1017_p", "source_sha256": "bd3cb3b243560b06fd1898082fc72e21f8f9061df62394e4850fa0733fffc6c9", "ja": "いや、約束って言うより、これは希望だな。\n朋花との散歩、楽しかったから。", "zh": "不，比起说是约定，这更算是一种期望吧。\n因为和朋花一起散步，真的很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0264_1018_031tom", "source_sha256": "3f1c484681dac7a064d96d25f403aeaa1be116155fdfb532d280fe501f0f9207", "ja": "……。\n仕方ありませんね～。うふふふ……。", "zh": "……。\n真拿您没办法呢～。呵呵呵……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0264_1019_p", "source_sha256": "41c690a7dc7f1361532cdc66379c451dc0714ce5b9e9fd493a8696f4e4d950d0", "ja": "（……うっ！？　朋花から強力なプレッシャーが！\n何か、変な事言ったっけ！？）", "zh": "（……呜！？朋花施加了好强的压力！我刚才说了什么奇怪的话吗！？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0264_1020_se", "source_sha256": "0d1f44b9d728b6ed8456ee66b5c05eaf0ff1e0a0ac3e002eb288e0c437a75122", "ja": "サーッ……", "zh": "沙沙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0264_1021_031tom", "source_sha256": "5bb6b74136369432a54db8d94d86bff7fc9ee1b18fbb1b5c980b629e0a4d7fa8", "ja": "……。おや～？　うふふ。\n見てください、雨脚が弱くなってきましたよ～？", "zh": "……哎呀～？呵呵。\n您瞧，雨势变小了哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0264_1022_p", "source_sha256": "43a1f2005010ba3dcb3b1482f243bbb55d72260f7ca311b6a4c39b057471c257", "ja": "えっ！？　あっ、ホントだ……。", "zh": "咦！？啊，真的耶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0264_1023_031tom", "source_sha256": "bffe7acf927a3cdabe072597d3915e9d4c50325f32be2ce52a74c72e4d6ddfe7", "ja": "うふふ♪　{$P$}さん？　自分から\n言ったのですから、ちゃんと守ってくださいね～。", "zh": "呵呵♪　{$P$}先生？　既然是您自己\n说出口的，可要好好遵守哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0264_1024_031tom", "source_sha256": "3335c18beac08e674daa189946b1b22764756b86f64402ad7de7e4b032f3dced", "ja": "撮影が終わったら、散歩。\nしっかりと、エスコートしてもらいますからね～。", "zh": "拍摄结束后，我们去散步吧。\n到时候可要好好地由您来陪同哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0264_1025_p", "source_sha256": "1175ed41e4460a21a32aafa8c6560e3e940f513fadd49a42a6afe800fd2e7070", "ja": "（……偶然、だよな？）", "zh": "（……是巧合吧？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
